{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, craft, and survive as a little girl trapped in a vast underground world filled with danger and mystery. Gather resources, build your base, and prepare for relentless zombie hordes that strike every few nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sprawling caves, dig deep into the earth, and use your wits to outsmart the undead. When survival gets tough, climb into powerful robot exo-suits to mine faster, fight harder, and explore deeper than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a struggle to grow stronger. Every night is a battle for survival. Can you hold your ground, or will the horde overwhelm you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine &amp; Gather Resources</strong> \u2013 Rocks, ores, and rare treasures are scattered across massive underground caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/1826d19857adff66abc59ddc27508bd2.poster.avif?t=1768167053\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/1826d19857adff66abc59ddc27508bd2.webm?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/1826d19857adff66abc59ddc27508bd2.mp4?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft &amp; Build</strong> \u2013 Turn your findings into tools, weapons, and defenses to keep yourself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/0aef198fd8964a9c314be564a28fe7f0.poster.avif?t=1768167053\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/0aef198fd8964a9c314be564a28fe7f0.webm?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/0aef198fd8964a9c314be564a28fe7f0.mp4?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Mighty Robots</strong> \u2013 Wear exo-skeleton machines that boost your mining, combat, and exploration abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/f9d78b07c1fa144eea07e106e42ada3a.poster.avif?t=1768167053\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/f9d78b07c1fa144eea07e106e42ada3a.webm?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/f9d78b07c1fa144eea07e106e42ada3a.mp4?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Horde</strong> \u2013 Zombies don\u2019t stop. Every few days, waves of the undead will attack your base. Prepare wisely!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/439ba4b7a67ebd47efa7d8eec0b620b2.poster.avif?t=1768167053\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028940/extras/439ba4b7a67ebd47efa7d8eec0b620b2.webm?t=1768167053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima